      },
      "text": "Strong liability enforcement could be helpful in the AI debate. \n\nIf your agent swarm goes rogue, you’re liable.\n\nIf your weakly protected model gets jailbroken, you’re liable.\n\nIf you serve a weakly protected OSS model, you’re liable.",
